    - D01 A Click Highlights The Value
        area: cells
        fixture: Ledger below
        try: click inside 250 in the Basalt row and type 300, then click inside 300 a second time, then press Ctrl+Z
        expected: the first click highlights 250 whole and typing replaces it; the second click leaves a caret where you clicked
    - D02 A Click On A Formula Highlights The Formula
        area: cells
